<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Hospitality Project | CGLUX HOME</title>

<meta
name="description"
content="Hospitality interior design and custom furniture solutions by CGLUX HOME for hotels, resorts and international hospitality projects."
>

<link
rel="canonical"
href="https://cgluxhome-ga.github.io/projects/hospitality.html"
>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style.css">

<style>

/* ================= PROJECT PAGE ================= */

.project-detail-page {
    background: #fff;
    color: #222;
}


/* ================= PROJECT HERO ================= */

.project-detail-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 72vh;
    min-height: 520px;

    background-image:
        linear-gradient(
            rgba(0,0,0,0.30),
            rgba(0,0,0,0.30)
        ),
        url("../assets/images/hero/Projects/pjj003.png");

    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;

    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
}


.project-detail-hero-content {
    max-width: 850px;
    padding: 40px 25px;
}


.project-detail-hero-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}


.project-detail-hero h1 {
    font-size: 58px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}


.project-detail-hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}


/* ================= BACK BUTTON ================= */

.project-back {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 35px 25px 0;
}


.project-back a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #555;
    transition: 0.3s;
}


.project-back a:hover {
    color: #000;
}


/* ================= PROJECT INTRO ================= */

.project-intro {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 25px 70px;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
}


.project-intro h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}


.project-intro p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}


/* ================= PROJECT DETAILS ================= */

.project-details {
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding-top: 30px;
}


.project-detail-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;

    padding: 14px 0;

    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;

    font-size: 14px;
}


.project-detail-item strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #222;
}


.project-detail-item span {
    color: #666;
}


/* ================= PROJECT GALLERY ================= */

.hospitality-gallery-section {
    background: #f7f7f7;
    padding: 90px 25px;
}


.hospitality-gallery-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}


.hospitality-gallery-header {
    margin-bottom: 45px;
}


.hospitality-gallery-header h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}


.hospitality-gallery-header p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.8;
}


.hospitality-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 25px;
}


.hospitality-gallery-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
}


/* ================= SOLUTIONS ================= */

.project-solutions {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 25px;
}


.project-solutions-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}


.project-solutions-header h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}


.project-solutions-header p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.8;
}


.solution-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 25px;
}


.solution-card {
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    padding: 35px 30px;
    background: #fff;
}


.solution-number {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}


.solution-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}


.solution-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #666;
}


/* ================= CTA ================= */

.project-cta {
    background: #f4f4f4;
    padding: 90px 25px;
    text-align: center;
}


.project-cta h2 {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}


.project-cta p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;

    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.8;
}


.project-cta a {
    display: inline-block;

    padding: 15px 32px;

    background: #222;
    color: #fff;

    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;

    transition: 0.3s;
}


.project-cta a:hover {
    background: #444;
}


/* ================= FOOTER ================= */

.project-footer {
    background: #111;
    color: #fff;

    text-align: center;

    padding: 40px 20px;
}


.project-footer p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}


.project-footer a {
    color: #fff;
}


/* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */

@media (max-width: 900px) {

    .project-detail-hero {
        height: 65vh;
        min-height: 450px;
    }


    .project-detail-hero h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
    }


    .project-intro {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 50px;
        padding-top: 70px;
    }


    .solution-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

}


@media (max-width: 600px) {

    .project-detail-hero {
        height: 60vh;
        min-height: 420px;
    }


    .project-detail-hero h1 {
        font-size: 38px;
    }


    .project-detail-hero p {
        font-size: 16px;
    }


    .project-intro {
        padding: 60px 20px;
    }


    .project-intro h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
    }


    .project-detail-item {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 6px;
    }


    .hospitality-gallery-section {
        padding: 60px 20px;
    }


    .hospitality-gallery-header h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
    }


    .project-solutions {
        padding: 60px 20px;
    }


    .project-solutions-header h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
    }


    .solution-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }


    .project-cta {
        padding: 65px 20px;
    }


    .project-cta h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
    }

}

</style>

</head>


<body class="project-detail-page">


<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

<section class="project-detail-hero">

    <div class="project-detail-hero-content">

        <div class="project-detail-hero-label">
            Hospitality · Hotel & Resort
        </div>

        <h1>
            Hospitality Project
        </h1>

        <p>
            Interior design and custom furniture solutions
            for hotels, resorts and hospitality spaces.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= BACK ================= -->

<div class="project-back">

    <a href="../index.html#projects">
        ← Back to Projects
    </a>

</div>


<!-- ================= PROJECT INTRO ================= -->

<section class="project-intro">

    <div>

        <h2>
            Designed for Hospitality
        </h2>

        <p>
            CGLUX HOME provides integrated interior and furniture
            solutions for hospitality projects, combining design
            expertise with professional furniture sourcing and
            manufacturing in China.
        </p>

        <p>
            From hotel and resort interiors to custom furniture,
            we coordinate the process from design development
            and product selection to manufacturing, quality
            inspection, professional packing and international delivery.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our goal is to create comfortable, functional and
            visually consistent spaces while providing a practical
            furniture solution for international projects.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="project-details">

        <div class="project-detail-item">

            <strong>
                Project Type
            </strong>

            <span>
                Hotel · Resort · Hospitality
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="project-detail-item">

            <strong>
                Design
            </strong>

            <span>
                Interior Design · Furniture Design
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="project-detail-item">

            <strong>
                Furniture
            </strong>

            <span>
                Custom & Sourced Furniture
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="project-detail-item">

            <strong>
                Manufacturing
            </strong>

            <span>
                China
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="project-detail-item">

            <strong>
                Service
            </strong>

            <span>
                Furniture Solution & International Delivery
            </span>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= GALLERY ================= -->

<section class="hospitality-gallery-section">

    <div class="hospitality-gallery-container">

        <div class="hospitality-gallery-header">

            <h2>
                Hospitality Interior
            </h2>

            <p>
                A hospitality environment combining
                interior design, furniture selection and
                custom manufacturing.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="hospitality-gallery">

            <img
                src="../assets/images/hero/Projects/pjj003.png"
                alt="CGLUX HOME hospitality interior project"
                class="hospitality-gallery-image"
            >

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= SOLUTIONS ================= -->

<section class="project-solutions">

    <div class="project-solutions-header">

        <h2>
            From Design to Delivery
        </h2>

        <p>
            CGLUX HOME coordinates design, furniture sourcing
            and manufacturing to provide a complete solution
            for international hospitality projects.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="solution-grid">


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                01
            </div>

            <h3>
                Concept & Interior Design
            </h3>

            <p>
                Developing interior concepts and furniture
                directions based on the project's style,
                function and requirements.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                02
            </div>

            <h3>
                Furniture Design
            </h3>

            <p>
                Furniture solutions designed to coordinate
                with the overall interior concept and project needs.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                03
            </div>

            <h3>
                Furniture Sourcing
            </h3>

            <p>
                Selecting suitable furniture, materials and
                suppliers from China's manufacturing network.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                04
            </div>

            <h3>
                Custom Manufacturing
            </h3>

            <p>
                Coordinating customized furniture production
                according to approved designs and specifications.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                05
            </div>

            <h3>
                Quality Control
            </h3>

            <p>
                Following production and checking furniture
                quality before packing and shipment.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-card">

            <div class="solution-number">
                06
            </div>

            <h3>
                Packing & Delivery
            </h3>

            <p>
                Professional packing and international shipping
                coordination to help furniture arrive safely.
            </p>

        </div>


    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= CTA ================= -->

<section class="project-cta">

    <h2>
        Have a Hospitality Project?
    </h2>

    <p>
        Tell us about your hotel, resort or hospitality project.
        We can help coordinate furniture design, sourcing,
        manufacturing and delivery from China.
    </p>

    <a href="../index.html#contact">
        Request a Quote
    </a>

</section>


<!-- ================= FOOTER ================= -->

<footer class="project-footer">

    <p>
        European Design · Custom Furniture · Worldwide Delivery
    </p>

    <p>
        © 2026 CGLUX HOME. All Rights Reserved.
    </p>

    <p>
        <a href="../index.html">
            CGLUX HOME
        </a>
    </p>

</footer>


</body>

</html>
